<title>ITALY: Olivetti quoted steeply down pre-bourse.</title>
<headline>Olivetti quoted steeply down pre-bourse.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian information technology group Olivetti was quoted at 620 lire per share in pre-bourse opening trade on Monday and dealers said its opening would be delayed.</p>
<p>The stock, which was suspended at 749 lire throughout Thursday and Friday, has a 10 percent fluctuation limit on the bourse, beyond which it triggers automatic suspension.</p>
<p>&quot;Opening isn't possible with the parameter of a maximum 10 percent fluctuation,&quot; one dealer said.  </p>
<p>Traders were awaiting a decision from stock exchange regulators on whether to widen the trading bands.</p>
</text>
